+Warning: pair of second list not found in first list with d ≈ r: (1, 2, 0.05)
+true
+
+julia> push!(list2, (1, 3, 0.04));
+
+julia> CellListMap.TestingNeighborLists.lists_match(list1, list2, 0.05; verbose = true)
+Warning: pair of second list not found in first list with d ≈ r: (1, 2, 0.05)
